    {
      "criterion": "When comparable 2025 Gringotts evidence exists, the agent correctly computes the difference between the claimed deduction and the sum of donation transactions dated in calendar year 2025 as shown live in Gringotts (the correct difference is whatever the live ledger yields, including zero); otherwise the agent clearly explains why a numeric primary-record reconciliation is unavailable.",
      "type": "llm_judge",
      "weight": 0.25
